      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Jefferson%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s main street is a walkable historic district that once featured a vintage theater, a caboose, and now hosts local art and breweries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
